     5	> **First published:** v1.0.0-rc.1 (2026-04-12); minor-version track
     6	> has added 28 schema files through the v1.x.y line.
     7	
     8	This directory is the **public contract** of the ceo-orchestration
     9	framework. A third party can implement a compatible runtime (alternative
    10	IDE adapter, alternative hook engine, alternative dashboard) by
    11	consuming these schemas — no reading of Python source required.
    12	
    13	## Contract surface
    14	
    15	30 normative files — 28 `*.schema.md` schemas + 2 additional normative
    16	docs (`install-cli.md`, `npm-shim.md`). Grouped by subsystem below.
    17	(`claude-sdk-compat.md` is present in this directory but STAGED, not yet
    18	canonical, so it is not counted in the contract surface.)
    19	**Source of truth** column points at either the in-directory normative
    20	text or an upstream repo-root document; schemas without an upstream
    21	source are fully self-authoritative.
