   771	  "_model_pin_comment": "PLAN-163 T1.1 contingency (ADR-181 §Contingency) — session-default pin. CC 2.1.220 honors the top-level settings key \"model\" (zod: E.string().optional(); describe \"Override the default model used by Claude Code\"; source at 2.1.220 binary offset 226819212, sha256 8addc857..., positioned between \"permissions\" and \"fallbackModel\" in the settings schema — NOT the internal workflow prop \"defaultModel\", NOT the env var ANTHROPIC_MODEL). Pinned to claude-opus-5 (OQ1=b primary/fallback). Rationale: APPENDING claude-sonnet-5 to availableModels makes the 2.1.220 tier-default (sonnet-5) an ALLOWED model, so enforceAvailableModels no longer redirects the session away from it and the session default would silently FLIP from claude-opus-4-8 (=availableModels[0], the prior fallback target) to sonnet-5; the explicit pin forecloses that flip. The pinned value MUST remain a member of availableModels below or enforceAvailableModels rejects it (claude-opus-5 is present). Env ANTHROPIC_MODEL / CLI --model still override per-session at runtime. Mirror this key in templates/settings/settings.base.json or test_session_default_pin reddens.",
